  "description": "SpreadsheetML (.xlsx) for DocWright, dependency-free. Writes a workbook from your own data, byte-deterministically: worksheets, typed cells, number formats, fonts, fills and borders, merged ranges, column widths and row heights, outline grouping, frozen panes, autofilter and anchored images. Opens an existing workbook (XlsxDocument), reads its sheets and each cell's value, formula and format, and saves it back with every part it did not understand intact.",
